        header(),
        message('m1'),
        custom('c1', customType: 'model_request_summary'),
      ]);
      await repairSessionLedgers(fs, path);
      final firstRepair = (await fs.readTextFile(path)).getOrThrow();
      // A new ledger record lands; the user repairs again (exactly the
