## Plan

**RED tests:**

1. `test/session_repair_test.dart`:
   - "dry-run projects the real bytesAfter (gh-1590)": write fixture; `dryRun: true` report → `report.bytesAfter`; then real run → compare `bytesAfter` equality. Also both < bytesBefore. This FAILS now (dry-run returns bytesBefore).
