2. `test/cli/shell_job_ledger_caps_test.dart` (or a new test file): the throttle policy:
   - "N state changes within the window persist at most one snapshot (plus the trailing flush)": new `LedgerSnapshotThrottle`: `shouldPersistNow()` true once, then false while within interval; after interval passes (clock seam), true again.
